{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"本港未來3至4年新樓潛在供應回升至10萬伙\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PROP-SUPPLY-261030-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】本港未來3至4年新樓潛在供應回升至10萬伙。</p><p>房屋局推算，截至9月底，未來三至四年可提供一手住宅單位有10萬伙，按季增加4000伙，當中已落成未售出單位有1.9萬伙，與第二季時一樣；可隨時動工興建單位按季增加3000伙，至1.9萬伙。</p><p>今年第三季落成量1700伙，明顯低於第二季的6400伙。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:47.473055+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:42:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:10.309391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:10.309391+00:00","content_hash":"227a6a2e3ce5eb3cd5bffaf5acea80e6a6cbf07138d0b50949b2429d8b200993","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}